{"chunks": ["已", "确认您的 euf", "y S1 Pro", " 扫地机器人出现", "不吸尘的问题。", "\n\n最可能的", "原因是滚刷被", "毛发或异物缠绕", "，导致", "吸力下降。", "\n\n请执行以下", "操作：", "\n- 取出", "滚刷，清理", "缠绕的毛发后", "装回，并", "试运行观察", "是否恢复吸力", "。"], "key": "510d87e557ac54be181afcceb6cb3427368d1506bda7867c53c1768563922bd6", "kind": "model", "lane": "domestic", "mode": "stream", "model_used": "dashscope/qwen3.7-plus", "task": "reply.stream", "text": "已确认您的 eufy S1 Pro 扫地机器人出现不吸尘的问题。\n\n最可能的原因是滚刷被毛发或异物缠绕，导致吸力下降。\n\n请执行以下操作：\n- 取出滚刷，清理缠绕的毛发后装回，并试运行观察是否恢复吸力。"}
{"context_refs": {}, "key": "835c1d6da84a807c843f064b8ab72b08d472f53f375a71dcb46301b8debae26f", "kind": "model", "lane": "domestic", "latency_ms": 822, "method": "json_object", "mode": "invoke", "model_used": "deepseek/deepseek-flash", "output": {"instruction": "翻转主机，按下滚刷盖两侧卡扣取出滚刷，用附带清洁刀具割断缠绕的毛发后装回。"}, "schema": "StepRewrite", "task": "guide.step"}
{"allowed_count": 1, "hint": null, "hits": [{"case_outcome": "n/a", "chunk_id": "df4f9572-9f1a-4762-a135-e38216c79982", "context_chunk_ids": [], "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "troubleshooting_rv", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "df4f9572-9f1a-4762-a135-e38216c79982", "expanded_from": null, "full_text": null, "grade": null, "knowledge_id": "52e821fa-7f92-4116-8be3-352f16342f3d", "knowledge_title": "扫地机器人排障手册（客服内部版）", "parent_chunk_id": "6813263c-4208-4488-ae85-a01d668e2ef7", "round": 1, "rrf_score": null, "score": 0.016393442622950817, "snippet": "# 扫地机器人排障手册（客服内部版）\n\n## A. 吸力下降 / 扫不干净\n1. 先问三件事：多久没清理滚刷、滤网是否洗过、尘盒是否倒空。\n2. 按「滚刷 → 滤网 → 尘盒 → 吸口」顺序引导，每步让用户试运行并反馈。\n3. 若四步均无效且伴随异响，转电机故障流程（见 D）。", "source": "kb_manual", "source_queries": []}, {"case_outcome": "n/a", "chunk_id": "52677bb8-25c6-4f5f-a0b3-0fed975aef26", "context_chunk_ids": [], "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "troubleshooting_rv", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "52677bb8-25c6-4f5f-a0b3-0fed975aef26", "expanded_from": null, "full_text": null, "grade": null, "knowledge_id": "52e821fa-7f92-4116-8be3-352f16342f3d", "knowledge_title": "扫地机器人排障手册（客服内部版）", "parent_chunk_id": "6813263c-4208-4488-ae85-a01d668e2ef7", "round": 1, "rrf_score": null, "score": 0.01605222734254992, "snippet": "2. 检查尘盒触点是否被灰尘覆盖，用干布擦拭。\n3. 仍提示 → 升级人工。\n\n## D. 异响 / 焦味 / 过热（安全流程）\n出现以上任一现象，不再引导用户排查，立即告知关机停用，收集购买凭证后升级人工。此为强制规则（R4）。\n\n## E. 充电问题\n1. 确认基站电源灯亮，触点无灰尘。\n2. 手动放回基站，观察 5 分钟内是否开始充电。\n3. 无法充电 → 升级人工。", "source": "kb_manual", "source_queries": []}, {"case_outcome": "n/a", "chunk_id": "b318956c-03ff-409b-910c-db9df04bf035", "context_chunk_ids": [], "counter_evidence": false, "doc_id": "troubleshooting_rv", "doc_version": "2026-09-12.1", "evidence_id": "b318956c-03ff-409b-910c-db9df04bf035", "expanded_from": null, "full_text": null, "grade": null, "knowledge_id": "52e821fa-7f92-4116-8be3-352f16342f3d", "knowledge_title": "扫地机器人排障手册（客服内部版）", "parent_chunk_id": "6813263c-4208-4488-ae85-a01d668e2ef7", "round": 1, "rrf_score": null, "score": 0.015949820788530467, "snippet": "3. 若四步均无效且伴随异响，转电机故障流程（见 D）。\n\n## B. 边刷不转\n1. 关机后拆下边刷，清理缠绕的毛发与线头。\n2. 检查边刷轴是否有异物或进水，擦干后装回。\n3. 仍不转 → 边刷电机故障，升级人工。\n\n## C. 提示「请检查尘盒」\n1. 取出尘盒重新安装，确认听到咔哒声。\n2. 检查尘盒触点是否被灰尘覆盖，用干布擦拭。\n3. 仍提示 → 升级人工。", "source": "kb_manual", "source_queries": []}], "kb": "kb_manual", "key": "d766a9342bcd12781c06d6076ea7ca543b50faadb4cc377e25ccfeea365b51e3", "kind": "knowledge", "query": "eufy S1 Pro 扫地机器人 不吸了", "scope": {"category": "robot_vacuum", "product_state": "confirmed_sku", "sku": "EUFY-S1-PRO"}, "status": "ok", "top_k": 5, "truncated": false}
